e/godot/issues/104128","id":2725454753,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6icyOh","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-14T18:25:23Z","updated_at":"2025-03-14T18:25:23Z","body":"\"Only implemented\" is used for multiple cases 6 times, 8 times for a single OS, so there's no such strong tendency\r\n\r\nFor \"only supported\" it's 7 for multiple, and 3 for single cases\r\n\r\nThere's other combinations I didn't look at, but there's no issue with \"only\" here IMO","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725454753/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2725467571","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104128#issuecomment-2725467571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104128","id":2725467571,"node_id":"IC_kw